    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "https://www.auctioneera.ie/property/2-clonavon-curraheen-road-bishopstown-cork-city-bishopstown-cork-t12fx6d\r\nImportant note: Details of upcoming viewings and latest offers are available at the Auctioneera website link above.\r\n\r\nAuctioneera is delighted to present 2 Clonavon, Curraheen Road, Bishopstown.\r\n\r\nNestled within a tranquil cul-de-sac, this property is a perfect blend of privacy and convenience. This attractive detached home boasts a charming architectural design and occupies a generous plot with beautifully proportioned front and rear gardens. A spacious driveway provides parking for up to four vehicles, adding to the property's practicality. Offering a wonderful blank canvas, the home presents exceptional potential for modernisation and personalisation, allowing the next owner to create their ideal living space. To the rear, the generous, unoverlooked garden enjoys an excellent level of privacy, providing a peaceful setting for relaxing, entertaining, or family life.\r\n\r\nAs you enter, you're welcomed by a well-lit hallway that leads into a spacious living room. This area is enhanced by a feature fireplace and large windows that supply natural light, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere. Adjacent to the living room, the dining area is highlighted by elegant large doors that provide easy access to the garden, ideal for both relaxed family gatherings and entertaining guests.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen is well-appointed with modern cabinetry and plentiful surface space, making it an ideal setting for those who enjoy cooking. A separate utility room provides additional storage and functionality. There is also a guest bathroom for added convenience.\r\n\r\nFurthermore, four well-proportioned bedrooms await, each presenting ample storage solutions and an abundance of natural light. The master bedroom is noteworthy for its spacious layout and an ensuite bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe property's location is unparalleled, with proximity to esteemed local amenities including primary and secondary schools, shopping centres, and the Cork Institute of Technology. Excellent transport links are available, with bus stops just a short walk away, facilitating easy commuting around Cork.\r\n\r\nThis property represents an ideal purchase for families seeking more space, investors interested in a lucrative rental market, or  desiring a peaceful retreat with convenient city access."
      },
